  pocketRead: Routine nearby pockets usually pay out Abyssal Crystal.
  nodeRead: Heavier node clusters here usually lead to Thermal Gel.
  safePocketRead: Short relief spaces often still give Thermal Gel, so retreat is
    not empty.
